      en: ["Pico Torrecilla is the highest peak in the Sierra at 1,919 meters.", "The Gesm abyss is over 1,100 meters deep, ranking among the world's deepest.", "The region was recognized as a UNESCO Biosphere Reserve in 1995.", "Spanish fir trees in this park can live for over 500 years.", "The Sierra de las Nieves is home to Spanish ibex and golden eagles.", "The National Park covers an area of more than 23,000 hectares."],
