      en: ["The Sierra de Oropesa is located in the province of Castellón, Spain.", "The range runs parallel to the Costa del Azahar on the Mediterranean Sea.", "The mountains are primarily composed of limestone formations.", "The Columbretes Islands are visible from the peaks on clear days.", "The area contains several ruins of medieval defensive watchtowers.", "The vegetation consists of Mediterranean shrubland and pine forests."],
